103 |      *  - a materialized row is shown only while its template is still Active
104 |      *    AND still matches the hire's stage + position (legacy/manual items
105 |      *    with no template link always stay visible);
106 |      *  - duplicate rows copied from the same template item are collapsed into
107 |      *    a single entry (first, newest state wins);
108 |      *  - every un-materialized item of every matching Active template is shown
109 |      *    as a pending "virtual" item, so activating (or creating) a template
110 |      *    makes it appear for existing hires without copying any rows.
111 |      *
112 |      * Returns the exact payload used by the API (NewHireResource and the
